<title>ARGENTINA: Capex Q1 net rises to $8.56 mln.</title>
<headline>Capex Q1 net rises to $8.56 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period ended July 31</p>
<p>Shr N.A.</p>
<p>Net $8.56 million vs $7.75 million</p>
<p>Revs $22.1 million vs $15.3 million</p>
<p>Note: Capex S.A. said its total net assets amounted to $213 million</p>
<p>-- Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 318-0618</p>
</text>
